 driver's: the test host put the game's cursor on the pointer. Its GDI
 surface shows a white strip at x 2240-2496 in host mode where the plain
 driver shows black; not yet explained. Old Clock (cnc-ddraw, windowed):
 works through Second Chance's host, no driver change.
 2026-11-21 (size limits, real host): through Second Chance's host,
 Notepad's limits (asked for after window_create) were applied as the
 window's content min/max; a live resize (QUERY_RESIZE_START, then
 FRAME_CHANGED and RESIZE_ENDED) stopped at 111 wide, Notepad redrew at
